<!-- 
| Feature/Gaps           | Status    | Technical Observation                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 |
| **Register Map**       | **FULL**  | Populated based on `spi_reg.h`. Covers Master/Slave configuration, detailed timing (Phase/Period), FIFO management, and interrupt control.                                                                                                                                            |
| **Adaptive FIFO**      | **FULL**  | Integrated `SPI_FIFO_CONFIG_0/1` registers. Correctly identified the TX FIFO reset count of 32 (`0x20`) as specified in the header bit-fields.                                                                                                                                         |
| **Timing Precision**   | **FULL**  | Captured four-phase duration configuration (`cr_spi_prd_s`, `cr_spi_prd_p`, `cr_spi_prd_d_ph_0`, `cr_spi_prd_d_ph_1`) and inter-frame delay (`cr_spi_prd_i`).                                                                                                                         |
| **Interrupts**         | **FULL**  | Comprehensive mapping of Status (RO), Mask (RW), Clear (W1C), and Enable (RW) fields. Specifically, handled the non-contiguous Clear bits (0x10, 0x13, 0x14).                                                                                                                            |
| **Data Handling**      | **FULL**  | Added `SPI_RXD_IGNR` (0x18) for ignoring specific bits in RX stream and `SPI_STO_VALUE` (0x1C) for slave-mode timeout detection.                                                                                                                                                      |
| **I/O Management**     | **FULL**  | Integrated `BACKUP_IO_EN` (0xFC) for alternate pin-mux support and hardware deglitch logic (`cr_spi_deg_en/cnt`) in the main config register.                                                                                                                                         |
| **Reset Values**       | Added     | Reset values for all fields integrated from the `struct spi_reg` bitfield annotations. Note: `SPI_PRD_0` reset is `0xFFFFFFFF` (all fields 0xF).                                                                                                                                       |
| **Base Address**       | Explicit | 0x2000A200.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           |
-->
